        "shareclues :parameters (?informant ?recipient - police ?c - crime ?i - item ?location - place) :precondition (and (at ?informant ?location) (alive ?informant) (at ?recipient ?location) (alive ?recipient) (clue ?c ?i ?location) (knows-clue ?informant ?c ?i)) :effect (and (knows-clue ?recipient ?c ?i)))": "(:action shareclues :parameters (?informant ?recipient - police ?c - crime ?i - item ?location - place) :precondition (and (at ?informant ?location) (alive ?informant) (at ?recipient ?location) (alive ?recipient) (clue ?c ?i ?location) (knows-clue ?informant ?c ?i)) :effect (and (knows-clue ?recipient ?c ?i)))",
